descriptions.job-10v55qz:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world&#39;s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Product Sales is a team of functional and technical specialists who both lead and advise on deals for the most strategically important products in Stripe’s portfolio. Revenue suite Product Sales is tasked with attacking a $100B market opportunity for back office finance automation across billing, tax, revenue reporting, and data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Billing Account Executive at Stripe, you&#39;ll use your sales and product expertise to help drive growth through both existing and new-to-Stripe customers. You&#39;ll collaborate with the core sales, marketing, product marketing, and product teams to develop deep product and industry knowledge and drive strategic deals. You&#39;ll lead in-depth product discussions with existing and prospective customers and build and execute against our go-to-market strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive revenue to achieve and overperform on targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead new sales and upsell conversations of Stripe for existing and prospective customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive strategic thought leadership within assigned territory to ensure user success and revenue growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the sales process and competitors for Stripe, including software, hardware, and payments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as both an internal and customer-facing expert on Stripe, especially for your specialized products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Synthesize and relay customer feedback and our findings to inform Stripe&#39;s product roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with Product, Marketing, and User Operations teams to help amplify our growth trajectory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;re an adept salesperson, capable of engaging in business-level and technical conversations at multiple levels of the organization, including CEO, CFO, and CTO. You&#39;re used to building value in competitive situations and enjoy working on products that require deep product understanding, combined with technical knowledge. You&#39;re as comfortable working with clients as with internal stakeholders (including executives). You&#39;re excited to become an expert and to share your knowledge. You&#39;re an organized self-starter, an excellent communicator who is detail-oriented and has a track record for improving the processes and organizations around you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of sales or prospecting experience at a technology company and a track record of top performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning a direct sales quota, with direct sales experience closing new business and expanding existing users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven ability to build strong collaborative working relationships with business partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to deal with ambiguity and thrive in an unstructured, fast-moving environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven ability to be a self-starter capable of driving business results without significant supervision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hands-on mentality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation skills, particularly for in-person meetings with multiple stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to lead complex negotiations involving bespoke commercial agreements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to understand complex technical requirements and craft solutions across multiple stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience selling financial services or similar software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in selling billing solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to sell in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

descriptions.job-19m768r:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The team brings Link’s brand and product stories to life through compelling, platform-native organic social content. Working closely with Brand, Creative, and agency partners, we turn strong ideas into high-quality storytelling that informs and engages audiences. The team also tests new creative approaches, uses performance and community insights to refine what works, and shares learnings across the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brand extension into organic social&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Steward Link’s brand promise, brand voice and tone and creative standards for the organic social channels (in particular, Instagram, TikTok, and X); you&#39;re the internal authority on what on-brand looks like within the organic channel working in close partnership with our head of brand internally&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate Link’s broader brand positioning into social-specific strategies and briefing frameworks the agency can work from with clear guardrails&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and pressure-test agency-originated ideas for brand integrity before they get produced; catch what&#39;s off and redirect with specificity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our Head of Brand to ensure social is a genuine expression of brand health, a testing ground, and a helpful input to shape the evolution of our brand over time based on learnings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Strategy &amp;amp; Channel Direction&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve platform-specific strategies with clear rationale: which channels we&#39;re on, what role each plays, what &quot;winning&quot; looks and feels like on each&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring platform fluency to evaluate whether agency ideas are actually native to each channel, knowing the difference between a post that was adapted for TikTok and one that was built for it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide the agency on format choices, creative approaches, and content types per platform; your direction should make their output sharper&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of platform shifts; be the internal authority on what&#39;s changing and what it means for our creative approach and channel mix&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agency Direction &amp;amp; Partnership Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the agency relationship day-to-day: brief quality, feedback quality, creative reviews, and the overall standard of the work coming out of the partnership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and refine briefs that give the agency enough strategic and creative direction to produce strong first drafts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a review and feedback cadence that&#39;s efficient and that makes the agency&#39;s work measurably better over time; you&#39;re their best creative partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage agency output against brand standards, platform performance expectations, and business priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the stakeholder approval process.&amp;nbsp; Map who needs to weigh in at each stage, build the workflows that move content through Legal, Compliance, Brand, and leadership review without killing creative momentum, and get smarter about how to frame work to earn fast alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Editorial Oversight &amp;amp; Content Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the editorial calendar strategy — priorities, themes, moments, and content types — even when the agency is driving the calendar mechanics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and approve content before it publishes with a dual lens: is it on-brand and is it built to perform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over time as the channel content matures, ensure the content mix reflects a coherent strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Community &amp;amp; Engagement Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the escalation layer: anything sensitive, high-stakes, or genuinely ambiguous comes to you before it goes out&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Surface community signals: what&#39;s resonating, what&#39;s creating friction, what people are actually asking and relay that back into Product, Comms, and CS as useful input&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance &amp;amp; Measurement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the measurement framework: define what matters, ensure dashboards exist, and deliver performance reviews to marketing leadership that connect social activity to brand and business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate agency performance reporting and help refine as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use performance data to sharpen briefs and strategic direction; close the loop between what we’ve learned and what the agency is asked to do differently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Integration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate organic social into launch plans from Day 1 alongside Product Marketing and Brand Marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with PR/Comms on earned media, crisis response, and executive social presence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Legal and Compliance on content approval frameworks; keep the agency informed Stakeholder Alignment &amp;amp; Approval&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a stakeholder map: who has approval authority, who has input rights, and what the right sequencing looks like for different content types and risk levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design approval workflows that move fast without cutting corners.&amp;nbsp; The goal is fewer revision cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop the judgment and relationships to pre-align key stakeholders before formal review so approvals confirm, not derail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frame content for internal audiences as skillfully as for external ones.&amp;nbsp; Know how to present creative work in a way that earns confidence and moves decisions forward&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the agency’s guide through Link’s internal process; protect them from last-minute redirects by front-loading alignment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong candidates will have depth on both sides of brand and channel expertise&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brand Experience (non-negotiable)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7 years of experience that includes meaningful time working in or alongside brand strategy. You&#39;ve been in the room where brand positioning decisions get made and have developed real opinions about what brands stand for and why&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve stewarded a brand voice across contexts, partners, and platforms, including directing external partners to express it faithfully&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can evaluate creative work against a brand standard with precision, not just instinct and give feedback that actually improves the work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand how organic social contributes to brand health over time and can make that case internally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Channel Expertise (non-negotiable)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep platform literacy across Instagram, TikTok, X; you know each platform&#39;s mechanics, audience behavior, and content dynamics well enough to evaluate work made for them&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve owned or directed organic social at a channel level and understand what genuinely native content looks like versus content that was adapted and shows it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong short-form video instincts: you can evaluate, redirect, and improve video concepts and executions with confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical fluency: you can read performance data, ask good questions about it, and use it to drive better creative decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agency &amp;amp; Creative Direction Experience (critical for this role)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve managed an agency or external creative partner in a senior capacity — you know how to write a brief that unlocks good work, run a review that improves it, and hold a partner accountable without micromanaging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve navigated the dynamic of an agency bringing ideas to an internal team: you know when to push back, when to build on, when to redirect entirely, and how to do all of that in a way that keeps the partnership productive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your feedback makes work better — you can articulate what&#39;s wrong and point toward what&#39;s right with enough specificity to be useful&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Also Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Legal/Compliance on regulated or high-scrutiny content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional collaborator, particularly with Brand, Comms, and Product Marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent writer: briefs, feedback,Demonstrated ability to navigate complex internal approval processes.&amp;nbsp; You’ve worked in environments with multiple stakeholders (Legal, Brand, Comms, leadership) and know how to build the relationships and workflows that get good work approved without grinding to a halt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Plus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building creator or ambassador programs (and directing an agency to support them)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social listening platform fluency (Brandwatch, Sprinklr, Sprout Social, or equivalent)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI content tools for evaluating, prompting, and directing AI-assisted production from an agency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience at a fintech, payments, or consumer brand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience marketing to early-adopter audiences and/or in the agentic technology space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

descriptions.job-1qauz2z:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;HladdPLXIoNz4nxkqkCuk4rAs8v&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XCikdRR2xoZIjdxtCKcuOflrs8d&quot;&gt;Established in 2018, Bybit is one of the world’s leading cryptocurrency exchanges and digital financial platforms, serving over 80 million users across more than 200 countries and regions. Powered by world-class technology and a user-first mindset, Bybit delivers a seamless ecosystem across trading, payments, wealth management, custody, institutional services, and Web3 — connecting users to the future of digital finance.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IF06dI0MPoBwYfxbZ4zui13HsoC&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X5EbdOwvMoYuOmxQBbuueUEDsDd&quot;&gt;Our core values define how we build. We listen, care and improve to create products and experiences that put users first. Backed by a global team of ambitious builders, problem-solvers, and innovators, we foster a high-performance and fast-moving environment where talent is empowered to drive real impact at the global scale. Supported by 24/7 multilingual customer service and a strong commitment to innovation, we are shaping the future of finance through technology, collaboration, and bold execution.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LtVud2dO7oglqJxxZoOucqjJsPc&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RMHkdm4bPo66l3xMVO8ui1o8sle&quot;&gt;Today, Bybit is recognized as one of the most trusted and transparent platforms in the digital asset industry, continuing to expand its global presence while building the infrastructure for the next generation of financial services.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;0&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities：&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;1&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;-Review transaction monitoring alerts across fiat and crypto activity.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;2&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;-Identify unusual transaction patterns and potential financial crime risks.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;3&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;-Document findings and escalate cases requiring further investigation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;4&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;5&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements：&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;6&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;-Early-career candidates, including recent graduates or those with some relevant work experience.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;7&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;-Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with an interest in data.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;8&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;-Interest in AML, crypto and blockchain/on-chain activity.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;9&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;-Comfortable using AI tools to support analysis and improve efficiency.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-zone-id=&quot;0&quot; data-line-index=&quot;10&quot; data-line=&quot;true&quot;&gt;-Able to work accurately in a high-volume, fast-paced environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Bybit, we are committed to fostering a supportive and enriching work environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Our benefits include:&lt;br&gt;- Study Growth Fund: We support your professional development and continuous learning.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Events: Participate in regular team-building activities, workshops, and events designed to promote collaboration and innovation.&lt;br&gt;- Global Collaboration: Be part of a diverse, international team, working alongside colleagues from around the world.&lt;br&gt;- Career Advancement: Access opportunities for growth and advancement within a rapidly expanding global company.&lt;br&gt;- Internal Mobility: Grow with us- Your long-term development is important to us. We offer internal job opportunities to help build your career path.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

