&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-F2xJdSyPHoa1mPxrlW2lyGS4gdd&quot;&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q2MNdpNyuoTFjQxkR9BlC1kIgbf&quot;&gt;The successful candidate will have prior transaction monitoring / investigations management experience in the financial services, FinTech or cryptocurrency industries, ideally within a regulated environment. You will help support the day-to-day transaction monitoring and suspicious activity investigations and reporting program for financial crimes related to money laundering and terrorism financing. This role will also entail supporting the operational teams in building out processes along the investigations lifecycle. You will report to the Head of the Global FCC Investigations and collaborate closely with key stakeholders, including the MLRO, Risk and Law Enforcement Liaison teams. You will be expected to demonstrate strong expertise in Global AML/CFT regulatory requirements, investigative processes, systems design, and effective documentation practices.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-MwIodNFraoQ5ruxpUwJlWpmYggg&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/h3&gt;
