descriptions.job-0lj8657:
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work with the best&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are Orderly, the ultimate destination for decentralized trading platforms. We are not satisfied with the limitations of centralized exchanges or the complexities of building decentralized order books. We aim to make trading easy, fast, and secure for everyone. How? By fusing the simplicity of CeFi with the power of DeFi.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At the heart of the issue lies “liquidity”. Builders often grapple with a paradox; traders need liquidity, but liquidity demands traders. Our solution is simple as is bold –&lt;span class=&quot;text-primary-100 font-semibold&quot;&gt;concentrate all liquidity into one order book. One order book that connects all the liquidity in the crypto space.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our ambition doesn&#39;t stop there. We&#39;re omnichain, championing chain abstraction. We envision seamless transactions, where the underlying blockchain is merely a detail. By concentrating liquidity, we aim to redefine the crypto landscape, making bridging and wrapped assets a thing of the past.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are Orderly, and we are here to revolutionize DeFi, democratizing access to financial opportunities and fostering a fair, equitable paradigm for all.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Glimpse into Your Future at Orderly Network&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;What will you achieve?&lt;/em&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;f7efhx&quot; data-start=&quot;1146&quot; data-end=&quot;1403&quot;&gt;Own and drive product strategy and initiatives across our DeFi and trading products, working closely with engineering, design, research, and other cross-functional teams to identify user needs and build best-in-class trading and developer experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1fbm23t&quot; data-start=&quot;1404&quot; data-end=&quot;1601&quot;&gt;Leverage your deep understanding of DeFi, crypto markets, and on-chain products to identify opportunities, validate product ideas, and translate market and user needs into impactful products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1m6p02c&quot; data-start=&quot;1602&quot; data-end=&quot;1799&quot;&gt;Partner closely with engineering teams to understand technical constraints, identify bottlenecks, and make pragmatic trade-offs to ship high-quality products within time and resource constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1f3shij&quot; data-start=&quot;1800&quot; data-end=&quot;1948&quot;&gt;Define clear product specifications, requirements, success metrics, and priorities, while maintaining a strong focus on execution and user impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;em9j4g&quot; data-start=&quot;1949&quot; data-end=&quot;2083&quot;&gt;Use data, user feedback, and market insights to develop product strategies, evaluate opportunities, and drive product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;6pv8vi&quot; data-start=&quot;2084&quot; data-end=&quot;2242&quot;&gt;Lead prioritization, risk analysis, resource allocation, and trade-offs across multiple initiatives, while aligning stakeholders around clear product goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;v0p9jf&quot; data-start=&quot;2243&quot; data-end=&quot;2436&quot;&gt;Work closely with growth, marketing, and ecosystem teams to develop strategies that drive product adoption, market awareness, and engagement around the products and vision we’re building.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;What challenges will you face?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1asskke&quot; data-start=&quot;2933&quot; data-end=&quot;3098&quot;&gt;A fast-moving and highly ambiguous market: DeFi and crypto markets evolve quickly, and you’ll often need to make product decisions with incomplete information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;g1dcut&quot; data-start=&quot;3099&quot; data-end=&quot;3320&quot;&gt;Technical complexity: You’ll work closely with engineers and need to understand protocols, APIs, SDKs, smart contracts, on-chain data, liquidity, and trading mechanics well enough to make informed product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1sxmz7e&quot; data-start=&quot;3321&quot; data-end=&quot;3496&quot;&gt;Complex product trade-offs: You’ll need to balance user needs, technical constraints, business goals, market dynamics, and protocol considerations when making decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19aplyz&quot; data-start=&quot;3497&quot; data-end=&quot;3685&quot;&gt;High ownership and autonomy: You’ll be expected to independently drive projects from problem discovery through launch and iteration, rather than simply executing an existing roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ggpfh2&quot; data-start=&quot;3686&quot; data-end=&quot;3853&quot;&gt;Global collaboration: You’ll work with teammates across different countries, cultures, and time zones, requiring strong communication and self-management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;p5bhrb&quot; data-start=&quot;3854&quot; data-end=&quot;3916&quot;&gt;About you:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xo3alk&quot; data-start=&quot;4357&quot; data-end=&quot;4492&quot;&gt;5+ years of product management experience, with significant experience in DeFi, crypto, Web3, fintech, or financial products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;e3bzmf&quot; data-start=&quot;4493&quot; data-end=&quot;4604&quot;&gt;Deep understanding of DeFi protocols, crypto markets, on-chain trading, liquidity, and trading mechanics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;fr3r8x&quot; data-start=&quot;4605&quot; data-end=&quot;4760&quot;&gt;Proven track record of owning and shipping products end-to-end, from identifying opportunities and defining product strategy to launch and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;v1gxhb&quot; data-start=&quot;4761&quot; data-end=&quot;4887&quot;&gt;Strong product sense and the ability to turn complex technical or market problems into simple, actionable product solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1lxi30e&quot; data-start=&quot;4888&quot; data-end=&quot;4988&quot;&gt;Comfortable working closely with engineers and understanding technical constraints and trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1mnqi42&quot; data-start=&quot;4989&quot; data-end=&quot;5091&quot;&gt;Strong analytical skills, with the ability to use data and user insights to drive product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1dzwg8c&quot; data-start=&quot;5092&quot; data-end=&quot;5166&quot;&gt;Strong stakeholder management and cross-functional collaboration skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;18abvyo&quot; data-start=&quot;5167&quot; data-end=&quot;5232&quot;&gt;Excellent communication skills in both English and Chinese.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1mh5naj&quot; data-start=&quot;5233&quot; data-end=&quot;5341&quot;&gt;High level of ownership, curiosity, and the ability to operate independently in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested in Learning More?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our hiring process begins by meeting with our People Team, who help facilitate the process of placing you in your new role. You can expect to share your experience and ideas in online video interviews with our hiring team of management and potential new colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you have experience in developing trading systems or financial-related products is a&amp;nbsp;plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can prepare for this interview by mentally organizing your strategies and opinions on topics such as Web3, cryptocurrency trading platforms, and your vision of how to succeed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share this! Don’t be afraid of friends or co-workers stealing this job! We will find a place for you if you are unique and intelligent. Check out our &lt;a href=&quot;https://boards.greenhouse.io/orderlynetwork/jobs/5170520003&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;External Referral Incentives Program&lt;/a&gt; as well.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

descriptions.job-1wfxtsr:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Ripple, we’re building a world where value moves like information does today. It’s big, it’s bold, and we’re already doing it. Through our crypto solutions for financial institutions, businesses, governments and developers, we are improving the global financial system and creating greater economic fairness and opportunity for more people, in more places around the world. And we get to do the best work of our career and grow our skills surrounded by colleagues who have our backs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you’re ready to see your impact and unlock incredible career growth opportunities, join us, and build real world value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you’re ready to see your impact and unlock incredible career growth opportunities, join us, and build real world value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE WORK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer on the RippleX Platform Engineering team, you’ll play a critical role in ensuring the reliability, scalability, and security of XRPL infrastructure. The Platform team operates at the intersection of software engineering, infrastructure, and operations—managing critical services, public test environments, and internal developer tooling. With strong foundations in DevOps and GitOps, the team is focused on delivering fully automated, highly available, and cost-efficient systems that enable developer velocity and protect the health of the XRPL ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll drive the design and development of platform components and infrastructure services that support distributed, high-throughput systems. You’ll help evolve core systems through automation, monitoring, and incident response, while influencing technical direction and mentoring other engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement scalable and resilient infrastructure supporting production-grade XRPL services and public blockchain networks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build automation for infrastructure lifecycle, CI/CD workflows, and deployment pipelines using tools like Terraform, Helm, and GitHub Actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop systems and services that support observability, secret management, disaster recovery, and regional failover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve platform reliability through proactive instrumentation, alerting, and incident response in collaboration with observability and security teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to and maintain internal tooling, self-service workflows, and platform capabilities that support developer efficiency and service delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate new tools to improve infrastructure scalability and reduce manual overhead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or a related field—or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of professional experience, including 2+ years operating cloud-native infrastructure at scale (AWS/GCP preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills in Go, Python, or Java, with a deep understanding of Linux systems, networking, and concurrency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience with Kubernetes (EKS or similar), container runtimes (Docker/OCI), and service meshes (Istio, Linkerd, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building CI/CD pipelines and deploying infrastructure using GitHub Actions, GitLab CI/CD, or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in Infrastructure-as-Code (e.g., Terraform, Helm, Ansible) and related automation practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with distributed systems monitoring and observability using Prometheus, Grafana, or equivalent tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership and collaboration skills—able to align technical execution across teams while mentoring and developing talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and problem-solving abilities, with a focus on driving outcomes in complex and evolving environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;For positions that will be based in CA, the annual salary range for this position is below. Actual salaries may vary based on numerous factors including, among other things, an individual applicant’s experience and qualifications for the position. This range does not include equity or additional compensation, such as bonuses or commissions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;CA Annual Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$172,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$215,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO WE ARE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Do Your Best Work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The opportunity to build in a fast-paced start-up environment with experienced industry leaders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A learning environment where you can dive deep into the latest technologies and make an impact.&amp;nbsp; A professional development budget to support other modes of learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Thrive in an environment where no matter what race, ethnicity, gender, origin, or culture they identify with, every employee is a respected, valued, and empowered part of the team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;In-office collaboration for moments that matter is important to our culture, and we give managers and teams the flexibility to decide which 10+ days a month they come in.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Bi-weekly all-company meeting - business updates and ask me anything style discussion with our Leadership Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We come together for moments that matter which include team offsites, team bonding activities, happy hours and more!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Take Control of Your Finances&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary, bonuses, and equity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive benefits that cover physical and mental healthcare, retirement, family forming, and family support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Employee giving match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Mobile phone stipend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Take Care of Yourself&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;R&amp;amp;R days so you can rest and recharge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous wellness reimbursement and weekly onsite &amp;amp; virtual programming&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous vacation policy - work with your manager to take time off when you need it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Industry-leading parental leave policies. Family planning benefits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Catered lunches, fully-stocked kitchens with premium snacks/beverages, and plenty of fun events&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Benefits listed above are for full-time employees.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ripple is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We’re committed to building a diverse and inclusive team. We do not discriminate against qualified employees or applicants because of race, color, religion, gender identity, sex, sexual identity, pregnancy, national origin, ancestry, citizenship, age, marital status, physical disability, mental disability, medical condition, military status, or any other characteristic protected by local law or ordinance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please find our &lt;a href=&quot;https://ripple.com/legal/eu-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;UK/EU Applicant Privacy Notice &lt;/a&gt;and our &lt;a href=&quot;https://ripple.com/legal/ca-applicant-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;California Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; for reference.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
