&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Lg8EdIdyXo8mx9xwPIZlUMN7gxh&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;OKX&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; will be prioritising applicants who have a current right to work in Singapore, and do not require OKX&#39;s sponsorship of a visa.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxuslsyQOGHoiYb47TiA1n51Th&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Kpucdjv7JoAcSZxSf7PuRl5Yscb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;Kpucdjv7JoAcSZxSf7PuRl5Yscb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusxfrenHjJKtgnorBrzgGFPb&quot;&gt;At OKX, we believe that the future will be reshaped by crypto, and ultimately contribute to every individual&#39;s freedom.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusxfrenHjJKtgnorBrzgGFPb&quot;&gt;OKX is a leading crypto exchange, and the developer of OKX Wallet, giving millions access to crypto trading and decentralized crypto applications (dApps). OKX is also a trusted brand by hundreds of large institutions seeking access to crypto markets. We are safe and reliable, backed by our Proof of Reserves.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxusxfrenHjJKtgnorBrzgGFPb&quot;&gt;Across our multiple offices globally, we are united by our core principles: &lt;em&gt;We Before Me&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;Do the Right Thing&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;Get Things Done&lt;/em&gt;. These shared values drive our culture, shape our processes, and foster a friendly, rewarding, and diverse environment for every OK-er.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cfb8dvi9voxFkWxhNcmuJX50sZb&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;PNNZdiw4Yo1ZOmx8btbucw8qsLG&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-PiRwdXFmiomeQDxx0RUuDGJ1sag&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NrSYd8kjeoNTrexRDNsuNpZOsMd&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;B05AdkdHaoe2oVx8s9IlWr3ngOc&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ByURduprToUDimxeuMHlwvkcgId&quot;&gt;You will be joining a team at the intersection of strategic execution and executive operations. This hybrid role combines program management ownership with high-touch executive support, working closely with senior leadership to drive critical initiatives and ensure seamless day-to-day operations.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NQ1gdeOLNoEsm2xDroWukiwGs3g&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-HytwdMMd1o5PQtxqi9QudDSMsWV&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;B05AdkdHaoe2oVx8s9IlWr3ngOc&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AgKxdiLfno6wTTxldIklO9scgpf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Coordinate with internal teams and external partners to drive execution, track risks, and proactively resolve issues&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HuLudb37uoRLJLxS25Ll69o0gEg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Manage senior leadership&#39;s calendars, travel arrangements, meeting logistics, and expense processing, anticipating needs and ensuring smooth day-to-day operations&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AGaTdTbBRogFH8xsYVclHIBRgZA&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Act as a trusted proxy for executives, coordinating priorities, follow-ups, and communications across internal and external stakeholders&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SfqAdM3QXop1gUxJaVklChBVgFW&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Prepare program updates, reports, and presentations for leadership, and facilitate meetings to drive decision-making and alignment&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wl0tdoWWUo3NGbxviaPlTxvZg2d&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Establish and maintain program governance, workflows, and documentation while continuously improving processes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wl0tdoWWUo3NGbxviaPlTxvZg2d&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;GLXxduaLhorsx2x4uv2lBTorgmb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot; old-record-id-GiqudTQm1odsGdxnTgdlkMMAggb&quot;&gt;Help manage merchandise program end-to-end, including vendor sourcing, procurement cycles, inventory management, budget tracking, and fulfilment for company events&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wl0tdoWWUo3NGbxviaPlTxvZg2d&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;GLXxduaLhorsx2x4uv2lBTorgmb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CsrYdsaxfo3A3bxpS01lSQFngqt&quot;&gt;Provide administrative support and manage strategic projects for the CEO office&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
