&lt;h3&gt;About the Position&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Infrastructure Automation Specialist, you will be interfacing with various Infrastructure groups locally and globally to help manage the processes and tools used within and between such groups, as well as those used to interact with external parties. You will become familiar with both the broad flow of the trading/settlement cycle as well as the regulatory and operational considerations of each step. As you gain in-depth understanding of the day-to-day operations of each Infrastructure team, you will dedicate an increasing amount of time to the coding and development functions, as well as helping these groups monitor and update complex spreadsheets, optimize existing processes and develop new tools.&lt;/p&gt;
